-- Do not edit by hand: change the research and rebuild.
--
-- What this is. A reviewed research batch, the 050 / 055 method unchanged. It adds no table, view, function, grant or policy and changes no
-- definition.
--   * The MLB Pipeline international Top 30 list of the 2019 class, read from the archived official data feed as published before the signing
--     period opened (2019-06-30), as one new TOP_PROSPECT_SAMPLE population. A listed player becomes a benchmark signing only when the official
--     MLB transaction log shows his signing and his identity is resolved by more than his name (the 050 rule). The re-ranked edition of
--     2020-02-13 is not used. RANKING APPEARANCE != NEW SIGNING; RANKING CLASS YEAR != SIGNING YEAR; SOURCE LIST MEMBERSHIP != VERIFIED SIGNING.
