--     already stores. No benchmark copy, player or evaluation is created. BENCHMARK SUPPORT != DODGERS SUPPORT.
--   * Members that are not added are recorded in the population's stated composition and queued: three identities for a person (Robert
--     Puason, Yiddi Cappe, Enmanuel Rodriguez).
--   * MLB outcome audits at the unchanged 2026-10-05 boundary. MISSING BWAR != ZERO BWAR. A 2019 signing's 7-season reach horizon ends with the
--     2026 season (mature); its 10-season horizon (2029) is open.
--   * The stored 041 model evaluation, re-run on the 056 data with the same targets, features, models and out-of-time validation, so it is
--     current again (the previous rows are proven to be the 055 ones before they are replaced). No threshold moves.
-- It then runs the explicit snapshot refresh once, only when this run changed a row.
--
-- Rerunnable: every statement is idempotent; the refresh runs only when a row was added or changed.

